{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10412030","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10412030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1041203001:1":{"text":"하필이면 이런 상황에서 다시 만나게 됐네... 얼굴 보기 쉽지도 않은데 말이야.","source_cn":"没想到，我们好不容易再见面，却是在这样的情况下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C2A30E9DD59EEC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041203002:1":{"text":"그러게... 인사도 제대로 못 하고 또 각자 바쁘게 움직여야겠네.","source_cn":"是啊……还没来得及好好打招呼，就又要各自忙碌了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E6207E321AAEED0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1041203002":{"text":"그러게... 인사도 제대로 못 하고 또 각자 바쁘게 움직여야겠네.","source_cn":"是啊……还没来得及好好打招呼，就又要各自忙碌了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E6207E321AAEED0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041203003:1":{"text":"네, 맞아요. 저와 패리사, 에이론은 함께 에메랄드 호수 마법 아카데미를 다닌 동창이에요. 졸업하고 오랫동안 못 만났죠.","source_cn":"嗯，我和帕瑞莎、埃隆是同窗，曾经一起在翡湖学院读书，只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF421E59D3A569196","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041203005:1":{"text":"구구! 이렇게 깊은 인연이 있었다니, 저도 처음 알았습니다!","source_cn":"咕唔！居然有如此渊源，吾等也是第一次得知！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x741C5BC252FFBACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_